## Why Asked
Tests distributed systems design and API reliability skills
## Key Concepts
Token bucket algorithm, distributed state, Redis, burst handling
## Code Example
```
class TokenBucket {
  constructor(capacity, refillRate) {
    this.capacity = capacity;
    this.tokens = capacity;
    this.refillRate = refillRate;
    this.lastRefill = Date.now();
  }

  consume() {
    const now = Date.now();
    const elapsed = now - this.lastRefill;
    this.tokens = Math.min(this.capacity, this.tokens + elapsed * this.refillRate / 1000);
    this.lastRefill = now;

    if (this.tokens >= 1) {
      this.tokens--;
      return true;
    }
    return false;
  }
}
```
